secubox-metrics (1.0.2-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add Cookie Audit (RGPD / ePrivacy) endpoints: POST /api/v1/cookie-audit/ingest,
    GET /api/v1/cookie-audit/report?host=..., GET /api/v1/cookie-audit/summary.
  * Add CookieAuditAggregator reconciler — joins mitmproxy Set-Cookie ledger
    with browser document.cookie snapshots, flags rgpd_violation on JS-set
    non-strictly-necessary cookies.
  * Allow POST in CORS for the ingest endpoint.
  * Closes: #156

